      "StorePaymentAttemptStartRequest": {
        "additionalProperties": true,
        "description": "Optional JSON body for card/Pix payment-attempt start. Body may be omitted or `{}`. Payment method is defined by the path (`/card` or `/pix`), not by a body field. Matches runtime rejectClientMoneyFields: CLIENT_MONEY_BODY_FIELDS are structurally forbidden via propertyNames; unknown non-money keys are ignored (additionalProperties is intentionally true).",
